{title: Pahile Na Mi Tula}
{artist: Suresh Wadkar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Pahile na [F]mi tula tu [C]mala na pahile
[D#]Na kale [G]kadhi kuthe [F]man vede guntale
[G]Himavarshavatahi [F]kanti tav [G]pahuni ?
[G]Himavarshavatahi [F]kanti tav [G]pahuni ?
[G]Taraka [F]nabhatalya [G]lajalya manatuni
[G]Oghalale [F]himatushar [C]galawar thambale
[D#]Na kale [G]kadhi kuthe [F]man vede guntale
[G]Mrudushaiya [F]tochati swapna [G]nave lochani
[G]Paahiles tu [F]tula arashat [G]jya kshani
[G]Rupa dekhane [F]baghun nayan [G]he sukhawale
[D#]Na kale [G]kadhi kuthe [F]man vede guntale
[G]Ka ugach [F]jhakishi nayan [G]tujhe sajani
[G]Sangato gupit [F]goshta sparsha [G]tujha chandani
[G]Dhundalya tujhya [F]mithit deha [G]bhan harapale
[D#]Na kale [G]kadhi kuthe [F]man vede guntale
